---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="關於 Linahhsheng。">
	<section class="about" aria-labelledby="page-title">
		<header>
			<p class="eyebrow">About</p>
			<h1 id="page-title">嗨，我是 Linahhsheng。</h1>
		</header>

		<figure class="about-figure">
	<img
		class="about-photo"
		src="/media/profile.jpg"
		alt="我和 Binky 的合照"
	/>
	<figcaption class="about-caption">
		這是我和我的兔子 Binky！
	</figcaption>
</figure>
		<div class="content">
			<p>你也可以叫我林阿笙或阿笙！</p>
			<p>這裡是我在網路上的小窩，用來記錄我ㄉ笙活。</p>
			<p>在這裡你會看到日常、羽球、音樂、遊戲，或是我的一些想法。</p>
			<p>希望藉由記錄生活，能更了解自己，也更了解這個世界。</p>

			<p>
				如果你剛好讀到了我的文章，想分享你的故事、交流想法，或只是想打聲招呼，都很歡迎透過
				<a
					class="contact-link"
					href="mailto:linahhsheng@gmail.com"
				>
					Email
				</a>
				或
				<a
					class="contact-link"
					href="https://www.instagram.com/linlyusheng/"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
				>
					Instagram
				</a>
				聯絡我！
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.about {
		width: min(100% - 3rem, 640px);
		padding: 5.5rem 0 6rem;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		margin: 0 0 0.875rem;
		color: #ff7575;
		font-size: 0.8125rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		letter-spacing: 0.04em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	h1 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 7vw, 3.5rem);
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
		line-height: 1.2;
	}

	.content {
		margin-top: 3.5rem;
		color: #444444;
		font-size: 1.0625rem;
		line-height: 2;
	}

	p {
		margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 480px) {
		.about {
			width: min(100% - 2rem, 640px);
			padding: 4rem 0;
		}
	}

	.contact-link {
	color: #FF7575;
	text-decoration: none;
	transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
}

.contact-link:hover {
	text-decoration: underline;
	opacity: 0.8;
}

.about-figure {
	margin: 2rem auto 2.5rem;
	text-align: center;
}

.about-photo {
	display: block;
	width: min(100%, 260px);
	height: auto;
	margin: 0 auto;
	border-radius: 16px;
	object-fit: cover;
}

.about-caption {
	margin-top: 0.75rem;
	font-size: 0.875rem;
	color: #666666;
	line-height: 1.5;
}

</style>
